*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0003
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-07-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 398
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0003.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> LATE PAYMENTS IN LAST 12 MONTHS
    05 L-PY               PIC 9(2).
    *> DAYS PAYMENT IS LATE
    05 WS-DLT             PIC 9(3).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 AS-CD              PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 PA-AMT             PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM REPEAT-OFFENDER
    PERFORM 4100-TO-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "AS-CD=" AS-CD
    DISPLAY "PA-AMT=" PA-AMT
    STOP RUN.
REPEAT-OFFENDER.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF L-PY >= 2
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> REPEAT LATE PAYER SUSPENSION
    IF L-PY NOT < 3 AND WS-DLT > 45
        MOVE 'S' TO AS-CD
        ADD 100 TO PA-AMT
    END-IF.
4100-TO-COLLECTIONS.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF WS-DLT > 72
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> COLLECTIONS REFERRAL
    IF WS-DLT > 90
        MOVE 'C' TO AS-CD
    END-IF.
